  ('619M4iJ6bzL', 'US', 'home-kitchen', 'Cuisinart 17-Piece Pots and Pans Set, Non Stick Hard Anodized Cookware', 'Cuisinart', '/products/619M4iJ6bzL.jpg', 24749, null, null, false, 'Overall Pick', '100+ bought in past month', 'Amazon.com', 'Amazon', array['Even heat distribution with a sturdy aluminum core', 'Stay-cool ergonomic handles for a secure grip', 'Oven and dishwasher safe for effortless cooking', 'Complete set covers every everyday cooking need']::text[], 'This Cuisinart 17-piece set combines hard-anodized construction with a nonstick interior for durable, easy-release cooking. The hard-anodized exterior heats quickly and evenly, and the nonstick surface lets delicate foods like eggs and fish release cleanly. Stay-cool handles offer a secure grip, and tight-fitting lids help lock in moisture and flavor. With a broad mix of pots and pans, the set covers everyday cooking needs.', '[["Brand","Cuisinart"],["Material","Hard-anodized aluminum"],["Pieces","17"],["Coating","Nonstick"],["Handle","Stay-cool"],["Oven safe","Yes"]]'::jsonb, 111, 40, null, null, null),
