  ('81dQjX74L', 'US', 'sports', '5-in-1 Adjustable Dumbbell Set, Barbell & Kettlebell for Home Gym', null, '/products/81dQjX74L.jpg', 5249, 6399, 18, true, 'Overall Pick', null, 'Marketplace Seller', 'Amazon', array['Adjustable weight adapts as your strength grows', 'Space-saving design replaces a full rack of dumbbells', 'Secure locking mechanism for safe lifting', 'Durable, non-slip grip handle']::text[], 'This 5-in-1 adjustable dumbbell set converts into configurations that include dumbbells, a barbell, and a kettlebell, giving you a versatile full-body workout kit for home. Adjust the load as your strength grows, and store everything in far less space than a rack of separate weights. A secure locking mechanism keeps plates in place during lifts, and durable, non-slip grip handles provide control for presses, swings, and rows.', '[["Brand","Generic"],["Design","5-in-1 multi-function"],["Configurations","Dumbbell, barbell, kettlebell"],["Locking","Secure locking mechanism"],["Handle","Non-slip grip"],["Ideal for","Home gym"]]'::jsonb, 237, 124, null, null, null),
