  ('61gTcutSYML', 'Priya S.', 4, 'Battery lasts forever', 'After three weeks of daily use I have charged them only a handful of times. The battery life is honestly the best part, and a quick top-up gets me through a whole afternoon.', false, true, 108, '2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('61gTcutSYML', 'Daniel P.', 3, 'Blocks some noise, not all', 'They cut out a good amount of background chatter in the office, but low rumbles like the air conditioning still come through. Comfort and sound are otherwise good.', true, true, 57, '2025-09-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
