  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Michael T.', 5, 'Ideal for working from home', 'I use these all day for meetings and music while I work from home. Light enough that I forget I''m wearing them, and the controls are easy to find without looking.', true, true, 275, '2025-09-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
