  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Robert H.', 4, 'Great on long flights', 'Took them on a long flight and they made the engine drone much easier to tune out. The battery was still going strong when we landed.', true, true, 174, '2025-12-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
