  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Ashley W.', 3, 'Decent, but the mic is weak', 'Music sounds great and the battery is solid. On calls though, people say I sound a little distant, especially outdoors when it''s windy.', false, true, 15, '2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'My new commute essential', 'I wear these on my morning commute every day and they block out most of the train noise. I arrive at work without a headache for once.', true, true, 280, '2026-06-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Priya S.', 2, 'Uncomfortable for me', 'I really wanted to like these, but they press uncomfortably after thirty minutes. I tried adjusting the fit several ways and nothing helped, so they are going back.', true, true, 28, '2026-01-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('61PPiCaslSL', 'Nicole D.', 3, 'Fine for casual listening', 'They do the job for podcasts and background music. Picky listeners will notice the highs get harsh at high volume, but for everyday listening I have no big complaints.', true, true, 23, '2026-01-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('714leNyXHIL', 'Daniel P.', 5, 'Battery lasts forever', 'After three weeks of daily use I have charged them only a handful of times. The battery life is honestly the best part, and a quick top-up gets me through a whole afternoon.', true, true, 144, '2025-09-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('714leNyXHIL', 'Michael T.', 5, 'Pairing is painless', 'Paired with my phone in seconds and they reconnect automatically every time I switch them on. Moving over to my laptop is also quick, which I really appreciate.', true, true, 57, '2025-08-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('714leNyXHIL', 'Jennifer M.', 4, 'Great sound for the price', 'I wasn''t expecting much at this price point, but the sound is clear and balanced. Vocals come through crisp and the bass has real punch without muddying everything else.', true, true, 39, '2026-03-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
