  ('714leNyXHIL', 'Maria G.', 4, 'Beats my old expensive pair', 'Honestly these outperform the far more expensive pair I had before. Detail, clarity and comfort are all there, and I''m not scared to toss them in my bag.', true, true, 286, '2025-12-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
