  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Jennifer M.', 5, 'All-day battery for me', 'I unplug in the morning and still have charge left by the time I get home. After a month of use the battery life has stayed consistent.', true, true, 51, '2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Maria G.', 5, 'Keyboard is a joy', 'I type for a living and this keyboard feels great, with good travel and a satisfying response. The trackpad is smooth and accurate too.', true, true, 228, '2026-01-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Michael T.', 4, 'Gorgeous screen', 'The display is sharp and bright, and photos and shows look vivid. I can comfortably work next to a sunny window without squinting.', true, true, 189, '2026-05-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'David R.', 5, 'Quiet under normal use', 'The fans stay silent for everyday work like email, documents and streaming. They only spin up noticeably when I''m exporting videos, and even then it isn''t loud.', true, true, 150, '2025-09-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Daniel P.', 4, 'Handles creative work well', 'I edit photos and do some light video work, and this handles it smoothly. Previews render quickly and the screen makes editing a pleasure.', true, true, 40, '2026-02-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Priya S.', 3, 'Solid, but the fan is audible', 'Handles my workload without any trouble. The fan kicks in more often than I would like, even during video calls, and it''s noticeable in a quiet room.', true, true, 68, '2026-06-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Emily C.', 4, 'Easy to carry everywhere', 'I carry this between classes every day and it never feels like a burden in my bag. It still feels solid, with no flex in the lid or around the keyboard.', true, true, 63, '2025-07-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81RFGfu0skL', 'Robert H.', 2, 'Keyboard feels cheap', 'The keys feel mushy and a couple of them occasionally miss presses when I type quickly. For a machine I use mainly for writing, that is a dealbreaker.', true, true, 19, '2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Lauren F.', 5, 'Premium look and feel', 'The build feels premium, with a sturdy hinge and a clean, understated design. It looks right at home in client meetings.', true, true, 185, '2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Sarah K.', 4, 'Keyboard is a joy', 'I type for a living and this keyboard feels great, with good travel and a satisfying response. The trackpad is smooth and accurate too.', true, true, 278, '2026-03-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Robert H.', 4, 'Fast, reliable daily driver', 'Boots up in seconds and handles my browser full of tabs, spreadsheets and video calls without slowing down. Exactly what I needed for work.', true, true, 264, '2026-03-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Ashley W.', 5, 'Gorgeous screen', 'The display is sharp and bright, and photos and shows look vivid. I can comfortably work next to a sunny window without squinting.', true, true, 228, '2026-02-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Chris A.', 3, 'Nice keyboard, fussy trackpad', 'Typing feels good and the screen is sharp. The trackpad occasionally registers my palm while I type, so I mostly use a mouse now.', true, true, 47, '2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818ezjaaQlL', 'Jennifer M.', 4, 'Easy to carry everywhere', 'I carry this between classes every day and it never feels like a burden in my bag. It still feels solid, with no flex in the lid or around the keyboard.', true, true, 195, '2025-12-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
