  ('81jeyQboG0L', 'Emily C.', 3, 'Too many preinstalled apps', 'Once I removed the preinstalled apps and trial offers, it runs well and I''m happy with it. Getting there took an annoying first evening of cleanup though, and a couple of pop-ups kept nagging me to sign up for things I never asked for.', true, true, 49, '2025-08-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81jeyQboG0L', 'Robert H.', 4, 'Perfect for students', 'Bought this for my daughter heading off to college. It handles her assignments, research and streaming easily, and she loves how easy it is to take to the library. Three months in, she hasn''t called me once with a tech problem, which might be a family record.', true, true, 308, '2025-07-26T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('81jeyQboG0L', 'Chris A.', 2, 'Wi-Fi keeps disconnecting', 'It drops the wireless connection several times a day while every other device in the house stays connected. Driver updates haven''t fixed it.', true, true, 0, '2026-03-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
