  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Sturdy and well made', 'It feels solid and heavy in the right way, with a thick base that doesn''t wobble on the stove. Clearly built to last years of daily cooking.', true, true, 231, '2026-06-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Lauren F.', 5, 'So easy to clean', 'Cleanup is quick even after cooking something sticky. A short soak and a gentle scrub is all it takes, and it still looks almost new after a month.', true, true, 33, '2026-02-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Jennifer M.', 5, 'Lid fits snugly', 'The lid sits snugly and locks in steam well. Soups and curries cook faster than they did in my old pots, and nothing spills over onto the stove.', true, true, 48, '2026-05-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Daniel P.', 5, 'Cooks faster than my old one', 'Everything cooks noticeably faster, which saves me time and energy on busy weeknights. Very happy with how evenly it spreads the heat.', true, true, 234, '2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Kevin B.', 4, 'Heats evenly every time', 'It heats evenly across the base, so nothing scorches in one spot while the rest stays cool. My rice and vegetables have come out perfectly every time.', true, true, 258, '2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Nicole D.', 4, 'Nothing burns onto the base', 'After three weeks of daily cooking, food still releases easily and nothing has burnt onto the bottom. I use just a little oil and it has been flawless.', true, true, 140, '2025-08-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Arjun N.', 3, 'Cooks well, fiddly to clean', 'It cooks well and heats evenly. The only downside is that the edges near the handles collect grime and take extra effort to clean properly.', true, true, 59, '2026-01-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('818LlGeUuzL', 'Ashley W.', 2, 'Uneven heating', 'The center gets very hot while the edges stay cooler, so I end up with burnt spots unless I stir constantly. Not what I expected at all.', true, true, 5, '2026-01-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('719iqRlC1L', 'Chris A.', 5, 'Nothing burns onto the base', 'After three weeks of daily cooking, food still releases easily and nothing has burnt onto the bottom. I use just a little oil and it has been flawless.', false, true, 225, '2025-11-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('719iqRlC1L', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'Daily cooking made simpler', 'I cook twice a day for a busy household and this has quickly become my go-to. Meals come together faster, cleanup is easier, and I''ve stopped reaching for my older pieces altogether. My mother-in-law even asked where I bought it when she visited last month.', true, true, 71, '2026-03-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('719iqRlC1L', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Reliable for family meals', 'I cook for my family every evening and it has been completely reliable. Sturdy, consistent and easy to clean afterwards, even on the busiest nights.', true, true, 154, '2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('719iqRlC1L', 'Kevin B.', 5, 'Great gift for a new home', 'Bought this for my sister when she moved into her first apartment. She cooks with it almost every day and keeps telling me how easy it is to use.', true, true, 33, '2026-03-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
