  ('71eCmxe2qTL', 'Ashley W.', 3, 'Nice, but handles get warm', 'Cooks evenly and cleans up fine. The handles do get warm during longer cooking sessions, so I keep a kitchen cloth handy.', true, true, 0, '2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
