  ('81dQjX74L', 'Maria G.', 4, 'Great for beginners', 'I''m new to strength training and these have been perfect to learn with. Easy to use and comfortable, even for someone just starting out.', true, true, 233, '2026-07-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
