  ('81dQjX74L', 'Chris A.', 3, 'Good start, limited range', 'Perfect for where I am right now, but I can already tell I''ll outgrow them in a few months. Keep that in mind if you progress quickly.', true, true, 59, '2025-11-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
