  ('71sTw6pAXeL', 'Michael T.', 4, 'Tidy space saver', 'These replaced the pile of mismatched weights cluttering my spare room. Everything is tidy now and I actually want to work out.', true, true, 251, '2026-08-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('71sTw6pAXeL', 'David R.', 2, 'Grip is uncomfortable', 'The handle is too thick and slippery for my hands, especially once I start sweating halfway through a session. I can''t hold them securely for heavier sets, and I''ve nearly dropped one twice, which is not something you want to happen over your face.', true, true, 25, '2025-09-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Sneha P.', 5, 'Great sound for the price', 'I wasn''t expecting much at this price point, but the sound is clear and balanced. Vocals come through crisp and the bass has real punch without muddying everything else.', true, true, 169, '2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Ananya R.', 4, 'A gift that went down well', 'Bought these as a birthday gift for my teenage son and he has barely taken them off since. He says the sound is way better than his old pair.', true, true, 174, '2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Rahul K.', 4, 'My new commute essential', 'I wear these on my morning commute every day and they block out most of the train noise. I arrive at work without a headache for once.', true, true, 138, '2025-10-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Controls that make sense', 'The buttons are simple and responsive. Pausing, skipping tracks and adjusting volume all work on the first press, and the voice prompts aren''t annoying.', true, true, 30, '2026-01-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Siddharth J.', 3, 'Bass heavy for my taste', 'If you love bass these will make you happy. I prefer a more balanced sound and the default tuning muddies vocals a bit, though adjusting my phone''s equalizer helps.', true, true, 42, '2025-10-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Meera T.', 4, 'Comfortable for hours', 'Comfort was my main concern since I wear glasses and most headphones give me a headache by lunchtime. I can keep these on through a full workday without any pressure or soreness, and I''ve even fallen asleep wearing them on the couch.', true, true, 152, '2026-07-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Vikram M.', 2, 'Mic is nearly useless', 'Fine for music, but the microphone picks up everything around me and my voice sounds muffled. I bought these mostly for work calls, so that is a real letdown.', true, true, 61, '2026-07-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BWskzWNIL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Decent, but the mic is weak', 'Music sounds great and the battery is solid. On calls though, people say I sound a little distant, especially outdoors when it''s windy.', false, true, 0, '2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Divya L.', 5, 'Comfortable for hours', 'Comfort was my main concern since I wear glasses and most headphones give me a headache by lunchtime. I can keep these on through a full workday without any pressure or soreness, and I''ve even fallen asleep wearing them on the couch.', true, true, 182, '2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Amit H.', 4, 'Great on long flights', 'Took them on a long flight and they made the engine drone much easier to tune out. The battery was still going strong when we landed.', true, true, 325, '2026-03-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'Clear mic on calls', 'My coworkers say I sound clearer on these than on my laptop microphone. I take a lot of video calls from home and nobody has asked me to repeat myself since switching.', true, true, 40, '2025-07-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Vikram M.', 5, 'Controls that make sense', 'The buttons are simple and responsive. Pausing, skipping tracks and adjusting volume all work on the first press, and the voice prompts aren''t annoying.', true, true, 88, '2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Siddharth J.', 3, 'Decent, but the mic is weak', 'Music sounds great and the battery is solid. On calls though, people say I sound a little distant, especially outdoors when it''s windy.', false, true, 66, '2025-09-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Priya S.', 4, 'Perfect for the gym', 'They stay put during workouts and have survived plenty of sweaty sessions so far. Sound stays strong even with the gym music blasting in the background.', true, true, 303, '2026-02-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Rohan D.', 2, 'Battery falls short', 'The battery life is nowhere near what was promised. I get maybe half the advertised time at moderate volume, which means charging every single day.', true, true, 59, '2026-03-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-711l4y8aNlL', 'Rahul K.', 3, 'Fine for casual listening', 'They do the job for podcasts and background music. Picky listeners will notice the highs get harsh at high volume, but for everyday listening I have no big complaints.', true, true, 65, '2025-09-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71QdB7hDCAL', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Solid build quality', 'They feel sturdier than I expected, with no creaking and a finish that hasn''t scratched after a month of being thrown into my backpack.', true, true, 258, '2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
