  ('in-51rE6mPHnL', 'Rohan D.', 4, 'Great on long flights', 'Took them on a long flight and they made the engine drone much easier to tune out. The battery was still going strong when we landed.', true, true, 106, '2025-12-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51rE6mPHnL', 'Pooja B.', 2, 'Connection keeps dropping', 'The connection drops several times a day, even with my phone sitting right next to me on the desk. Re-pairing fixes it briefly, but it keeps happening, and it''s especially frustrating in the middle of a work call when I have to switch to my phone speaker.', true, true, 52, '2026-02-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51rE6mPHnL', 'Sneha P.', 5, 'Comfortable for hours', 'Comfort was my main concern since I wear glasses and most headphones give me a headache by lunchtime. I can keep these on through a full workday without any pressure or soreness, and I''ve even fallen asleep wearing them on the couch.', true, true, 17, '2025-09-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51rE6mPHnL', 'Karthik V.', 3, 'Fine for casual listening', 'They do the job for podcasts and background music. Picky listeners will notice the highs get harsh at high volume, but for everyday listening I have no big complaints.', false, true, 32, '2026-03-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51rE6mPHnL', 'Meera T.', 1, 'Tinny, flat sound', 'The sound is thin and lacks any real depth. Vocals are okay, but music feels flat compared with even my basic old pair. Not worth it in my opinion.', true, true, 34, '2026-07-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Neha C.', 5, 'Huge upgrade from my old laptop', 'Coming from a five-year-old machine, this feels incredibly quick. Apps open instantly and I no longer sit around waiting for updates to finish.', true, true, 67, '2026-06-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'No regrets after two months', 'After two months of daily work and weekend streaming, I have no complaints. Fast, dependable and comfortable to use for long stretches at a time.', true, true, 248, '2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Amit H.', 4, 'Easy to carry everywhere', 'I carry this between classes every day and it never feels like a burden in my bag. It still feels solid, with no flex in the lid or around the keyboard.', true, true, 263, '2025-12-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Rohan D.', 5, 'Setup took minutes', 'Setup was quick and straightforward. I had my accounts, files and apps ready to go within an hour of opening the box, with no calls to tech support.', true, true, 159, '2026-04-26T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Siddharth J.', 3, 'Good laptop, dim screen', 'Speed and keyboard are both solid. The screen is a bit dim for my liking and struggles near bright windows, though it''s perfectly fine indoors.', true, true, 39, '2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Kavya I.', 4, 'Keyboard is a joy', 'I type for a living and this keyboard feels great, with good travel and a satisfying response. The trackpad is smooth and accurate too.', true, true, 185, '2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Meera T.', 2, 'Loud fan all the time', 'The fan runs constantly, even with just a document open. It''s distracting in meetings and makes the machine feel like it is always struggling.', true, true, 54, '2025-12-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qLlDAZEL', 'Aditya G.', 3, 'Fast but runs warm', 'Performance is great for the price, but the bottom gets warm on my lap during longer sessions. I use it on a desk most of the time now.', true, true, 41, '2025-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71JcEk00fqL', 'Meera T.', 5, 'Fast, reliable daily driver', 'Boots up in seconds and handles my browser full of tabs, spreadsheets and video calls without slowing down. Exactly what I needed for work.', true, true, 278, '2025-08-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
