  ('in-71JcEk00fqL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Nice keyboard, fussy trackpad', 'Typing feels good and the screen is sharp. The trackpad occasionally registers my palm while I type, so I mostly use a mouse now.', true, true, 17, '2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
