  ('in-61AccNkmFFL', 'Vikram M.', 3, 'Too many preinstalled apps', 'Once I removed the preinstalled apps and trial offers, it runs well and I''m happy with it. Getting there took an annoying first evening of cleanup though, and a couple of pop-ups kept nagging me to sign up for things I never asked for.', false, true, 34, '2025-10-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Meera T.', 5, 'Heats evenly every time', 'It heats evenly across the base, so nothing scorches in one spot while the rest stays cool. My rice and vegetables have come out perfectly every time.', true, true, 111, '2026-07-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Sneha P.', 5, 'Nice weight, not too heavy', 'It has enough heft to feel like quality but is still easy to lift and pour from, even when it''s full. A good balance for everyday use.', false, true, 316, '2026-05-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Rohan D.', 4, 'Worth the upgrade', 'I finally replaced my worn-out old cookware and the difference is huge. Food cooks faster, nothing burns at the bottom and it looks great on the stove.', true, true, 62, '2026-03-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Divya L.', 5, 'Lid fits snugly', 'The lid sits snugly and locks in steam well. Soups and curries cook faster than they did in my old pots, and nothing spills over onto the stove.', true, true, 164, '2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'Nothing burns onto the base', 'After three weeks of daily cooking, food still releases easily and nothing has burnt onto the bottom. I use just a little oil and it has been flawless.', true, true, 104, '2025-10-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Vikram M.', 3, 'Nice, but handles get warm', 'Cooks evenly and cleans up fine. The handles do get warm during longer cooking sessions, so I keep a kitchen cloth handy.', true, true, 63, '2026-02-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Reliable for family meals', 'I cook for my family every evening and it has been completely reliable. Sturdy, consistent and easy to clean afterwards, even on the busiest nights.', true, true, 66, '2026-08-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61W5VjoziL', 'Rahul K.', 2, 'Uneven heating', 'The center gets very hot while the edges stay cooler, so I end up with burnt spots unless I stir constantly. Not what I expected at all.', true, true, 36, '2026-07-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-619CmDHn8L', 'Rahul K.', 5, 'Sturdy and well made', 'It feels solid and heavy in the right way, with a thick base that doesn''t wobble on the stove. Clearly built to last years of daily cooking.', false, true, 26, '2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-619CmDHn8L', 'Aditya G.', 5, 'Cooks faster than my old one', 'Everything cooks noticeably faster, which saves me time and energy on busy weeknights. Very happy with how evenly it spreads the heat.', true, true, 158, '2025-08-18T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-619CmDHn8L', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Reliable for family meals', 'I cook for my family every evening and it has been completely reliable. Sturdy, consistent and easy to clean afterwards, even on the busiest nights.', true, true, 177, '2025-08-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
