  ('in-619CmDHn8L', 'Amit H.', 4, 'Nice weight, not too heavy', 'It has enough heft to feel like quality but is still easy to lift and pour from, even when it''s full. A good balance for everyday use.', true, true, 51, '2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
