  ('in-51r9ZGmYADL', 'Vikram M.', 5, 'Lid fits snugly', 'The lid sits snugly and locks in steam well. Soups and curries cook faster than they did in my old pots, and nothing spills over onto the stove.', true, true, 20, '2026-01-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51r9ZGmYADL', 'Meera T.', 3, 'Good, not great', 'It does the job for basic everyday cooking. Heat spreads unevenly on my smaller burner, so I''ve learned to use the larger one whenever I can.', true, true, 30, '2025-08-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51r9ZGmYADL', 'Divya L.', 4, 'Cooks faster than my old one', 'Everything cooks noticeably faster, which saves me time and energy on busy weeknights. Very happy with how evenly it spreads the heat.', true, true, 174, '2025-09-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51r9ZGmYADL', 'Siddharth J.', 2, 'Uneven heating', 'The center gets very hot while the edges stay cooler, so I end up with burnt spots unless I stir constantly. Not what I expected at all.', true, true, 45, '2026-04-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51r9ZGmYADL', 'Sneha P.', 3, 'Nice, but handles get warm', 'Cooks evenly and cleans up fine. The handles do get warm during longer cooking sessions, so I keep a kitchen cloth handy.', true, true, 55, '2026-01-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61rWcMP4s9L', 'Karthik V.', 5, 'Perfect for morning runs', 'I run most mornings before work and this has been comfortable the whole way, whether it''s a quick loop around the park or a longer weekend run. Nothing rubs or chafes, so I can just focus on my pace and my playlist.', true, true, 311, '2025-12-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
