  ('in-61rWcMP4s9L', 'Kavya I.', 4, 'Soft from day one', 'The material felt soft from the first wear and hasn''t become stiff or rough over time. Easily one of the most comfortable things I own.', true, true, 237, '2025-11-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61rWcMP4s9L', 'Sneha P.', 5, 'Fits true to size', 'I ordered my usual size and the fit is spot on. Comfortable from the very first wear, with no adjustment period at all.', true, true, 135, '2025-08-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61rWcMP4s9L', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Nice look, a bit warm', 'Looks great and feels well made. It''s a little warmer than I hoped on really hot days, so I save it for cooler mornings and evenings.', true, true, 21, '2025-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
