  ('in-61BKbjrFySL', 'Siddharth J.', 4, 'Gentle on sensitive skin', 'My skin reacts to almost everything, but this hasn''t caused a single red patch or itch in three weeks of daily use. Finally something that works for me.', true, true, 89, '2025-07-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
