  ('in-61BKbjrFySL', 'Amit H.', 4, 'No breakouts at all', 'I have acne-prone skin and was honestly nervous to try something new, since most products leave me with a fresh crop of spots. Six weeks in, there are no new breakouts, my existing ones seem to calm down faster, and my skin feels less oily by the afternoon.', true, true, 49, '2025-12-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61BKbjrFySL', 'Karthik V.', 2, 'Broke me out', 'Within a week I had small bumps along my cheeks and chin that I don''t normally get. I stopped using it and my skin cleared up again.', true, true, 61, '2026-04-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
