  ('in-61BKbjrFySL', 'Rahul K.', 3, 'Great feel, runs out fast', 'I love how it feels on my skin, but it runs out quicker than I expected with daily use. I would buy it again, but probably only on a discount.', true, true, 19, '2026-07-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
