  ('in-61cZOENaP1L', 'Ananya R.', 4, 'Lightweight feel I love', 'The texture is light and pleasant, and my face never feels heavy, sticky or tight afterwards. It fits easily into my morning routine.', true, true, 303, '2026-01-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
