  ('in-61cZOENaP1L', 'Arjun N.', 3, 'Works, but slightly drying', 'It does what it promises, but my skin feels a bit dry by the evening. I pair it with an extra moisturizer and that solves the problem.', true, true, 62, '2025-07-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
