  ('in-61vq6mEiQ7L', 'Karthik V.', 3, 'Decent, smaller than expected', 'The quality is good and my daughter enjoys it. It''s smaller than I pictured from the photos, so check the dimensions before ordering.', true, true, 4, '2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Sparks imaginative play', 'My son comes up with new ways to play with it every day. It has sparked more imaginative play than most of his other toys combined.', true, true, 250, '2026-03-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Amit H.', 5, 'Not overly noisy', 'It isn''t loud or overly flashy, which I appreciate. My daughter can play happily in the living room while I work nearby.', true, true, 310, '2025-08-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Saved our rainy week', 'It saved us during a week of rainy weather stuck indoors. Both kids stayed engaged and actually took turns without arguing.', true, true, 9, '2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'Good value for money', 'Excellent quality for what I paid. It feels like something that should cost more, and it has already outlasted some pricier toys.', true, true, 130, '2025-08-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Divya L.', 4, 'Easy to get started', 'It took a couple of minutes to get ready and my daughter was playing right away. No complicated instructions or fiddly setup.', true, true, 60, '2026-03-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Vikram M.', 4, 'Safe and well finished', 'The edges are smooth, everything feels solid and there was no strange smell out of the box. As a parent, that peace of mind matters a lot.', true, true, 309, '2025-11-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Karthik V.', 3, 'Better for older kids', 'Well made and engaging, but a bit advanced for my three-year-old. I''ve put it away until she is a little older.', false, true, 3, '2025-07-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-810NYpQWZ1L', 'Neha C.', 2, 'Broke within a week', 'Part of it snapped off within the first week of normal play. My son was upset and I was disappointed by the overall quality.', false, true, 4, '2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Siddharth J.', 4, 'Holds her attention', 'My daughter usually loses interest in new toys within days, but three weeks later she still keeps going back to this one.', false, true, 259, '2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Rahul K.', 3, 'Engaging but a bit loud', 'The kids adore it, though playtime can get noisy. Great for the playroom, not ideal for quiet evenings at home.', true, true, 58, '2026-08-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Karthik V.', 3, 'Fun, but interest faded', 'My son loved it for the first week and played with it constantly. Now he picks it up only occasionally, but it was still worth buying.', true, true, 32, '2026-01-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Priya S.', 2, 'Strong smell out of the box', 'It had a strong chemical smell when we opened it, and I had to air it out for days before I felt comfortable letting my toddler play with it.', true, true, 43, '2025-08-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
