  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Sneha P.', 2, 'Poor quality control', 'It arrived scuffed and with a piece missing, which we only discovered after my son had already opened it at his party. The exchange took over a week, and explaining the wait to an excited six-year-old was not fun. The replacement is fine, at least.', true, true, 58, '2026-07-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
