  ('in-71PRHle65CL', 'Meera T.', 3, 'Mostly sturdy, some weak spots', 'Most of it feels sturdy, but a couple of spots seem fragile. Good for gentle play, less so for rough toddlers like mine.', true, true, 64, '2025-07-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-817az4dHG2L', 'Aditya G.', 5, 'Saved our rainy week', 'It saved us during a week of rainy weather stuck indoors. Both kids stayed engaged and actually took turns without arguing.', true, true, 47, '2026-02-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-817az4dHG2L', 'Meera T.', 4, 'Right for the age range', 'The age recommendation is spot on. My six-year-old finds it challenging enough to stay interested, but not so hard that she gets frustrated.', false, true, 225, '2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
