  ('in-817az4dHG2L', 'Neha C.', 5, 'Perfect birthday gift', 'Gave this to my nephew for his sixth birthday and it was the hit of the party. His parents told me he still plays with it every day.', true, true, 238, '2025-07-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-817az4dHG2L', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Better for older kids', 'Well made and engaging, but a bit advanced for my three-year-old. I''ve put it away until she is a little older.', false, true, 22, '2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
