  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'Great quality for the price', 'I expected something basic for what I paid, but the build quality is excellent. Feels like it belongs in a commercial gym.', true, true, 74, '2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Karthik V.', 5, 'Tidy space saver', 'These replaced the pile of mismatched weights cluttering my spare room. Everything is tidy now and I actually want to work out.', true, true, 68, '2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Meera T.', 4, 'Comfortable, secure grip', 'The grip has a good texture that stays secure even when my hands get sweaty. I''ve never felt like I was about to lose my hold mid-set.', false, true, 271, '2026-05-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Rahul K.', 5, 'Built to last', 'After four months of workouts five days a week, there is no wear, no loosening and no chipping. Built tough.', true, true, 235, '2026-08-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Weight feels accurate', 'I checked them on a scale out of curiosity and the weights were right on. Consistent and reliable for tracking my progress week to week.', true, true, 75, '2025-07-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Sturdy, with minor quirks', 'Overall sturdy and dependable, but there is a faint clinking sound when I move quickly. It doesn''t affect the workout, it''s just noticeable.', true, true, 47, '2026-04-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Great for beginners', 'I''m new to strength training and these have been perfect to learn with. Easy to use and comfortable, even for someone just starting out.', true, true, 62, '2025-09-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61qEWRcwEUL', 'Divya L.', 2, 'Grip is uncomfortable', 'The handle is too thick and slippery for my hands, especially once I start sweating halfway through a session. I can''t hold them securely for heavier sets, and I''ve nearly dropped one twice, which is not something you want to happen over your face.', true, true, 61, '2026-05-07T00:00:00.000Z');
