  ('in-618Nlj8pN3L', 'Karthik V.', 5, 'Balanced in the hand', 'They feel well balanced in the hand, which makes presses and rows feel smooth and controlled. No awkward tipping to one side.', true, true, 212, '2025-11-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
