  ('in-618Nlj8pN3L', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Shared by the whole household', 'My wife and I share them and both use them almost daily. Comfortable, reliable and exactly what we needed for home workouts.', true, true, 265, '2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z'),
