  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Aditya G.', 5, 'A gift that went down well', 'Bought these as a birthday gift for my teenage son and he has barely taken them off since. He says the sound is way better than his old pair.', true, true, 239, '2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Divya L.', 5, 'My new commute essential', 'I wear these on my morning commute every day and they block out most of the train noise. I arrive at work without a headache for once.', true, true, 319, '2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Kavya I.', 4, 'Clear mic on calls', 'My coworkers say I sound clearer on these than on my laptop microphone. I take a lot of video calls from home and nobody has asked me to repeat myself since switching.', true, true, 284, '2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Karthik V.', 5, 'Bass lovers will be happy', 'The bass is deep and full without drowning out the rest of the music. Hip hop and electronic tracks sound fantastic, and acoustic songs still feel natural.', true, true, 110, '2026-03-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Rohan D.', 4, 'Beats my old expensive pair', 'Honestly these outperform the far more expensive pair I had before. Detail, clarity and comfort are all there, and I''m not scared to toss them in my bag.', true, true, 13, '2026-06-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Sneha P.', 3, 'Decent, but the mic is weak', 'Music sounds great and the battery is solid. On calls though, people say I sound a little distant, especially outdoors when it''s windy.', true, true, 24, '2026-06-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Solid build quality', 'They feel sturdier than I expected, with no creaking and a finish that hasn''t scratched after a month of being thrown into my backpack.', true, true, 85, '2025-09-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51nBTTG3hNL', 'Arjun N.', 2, 'Mic is nearly useless', 'Fine for music, but the microphone picks up everything around me and my voice sounds muffled. I bought these mostly for work calls, so that is a real letdown.', true, true, 38, '2025-09-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Ideal for working from home', 'I use these all day for meetings and music while I work from home. Light enough that I forget I''m wearing them, and the controls are easy to find without looking.', true, true, 142, '2025-12-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Clear mic on calls', 'My coworkers say I sound clearer on these than on my laptop microphone. I take a lot of video calls from home and nobody has asked me to repeat myself since switching.', false, true, 224, '2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Arjun N.', 3, 'Blocks some noise, not all', 'They cut out a good amount of background chatter in the office, but low rumbles like the air conditioning still come through. Comfort and sound are otherwise good.', true, true, 57, '2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Rahul K.', 4, 'Beats my old expensive pair', 'Honestly these outperform the far more expensive pair I had before. Detail, clarity and comfort are all there, and I''m not scared to toss them in my bag.', true, true, 72, '2025-12-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Amit H.', 2, 'Battery falls short', 'The battery life is nowhere near what was promised. I get maybe half the advertised time at moderate volume, which means charging every single day.', true, true, 16, '2025-07-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Meera T.', 5, 'Comfortable for hours', 'Comfort was my main concern since I wear glasses and most headphones give me a headache by lunchtime. I can keep these on through a full workday without any pressure or soreness, and I''ve even fallen asleep wearing them on the couch.', true, true, 165, '2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Pooja B.', 3, 'Nice, with a few quirks', 'Sound and battery are both good. Occasionally the audio stutters for a second when my phone is in my back pocket, which is annoying but not a dealbreaker.', true, true, 34, '2025-08-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61vEGUBSswL', 'Vikram M.', 1, 'Tinny, flat sound', 'The sound is thin and lacks any real depth. Vocals are okay, but music feels flat compared with even my basic old pair. Not worth it in my opinion.', true, true, 20, '2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Vikram M.', 5, 'Controls that make sense', 'The buttons are simple and responsive. Pausing, skipping tracks and adjusting volume all work on the first press, and the voice prompts aren''t annoying.', false, true, 203, '2025-09-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Rahul K.', 4, 'Pairing is painless', 'Paired with my phone in seconds and they reconnect automatically every time I switch them on. Moving over to my laptop is also quick, which I really appreciate.', true, true, 252, '2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Bass heavy for my taste', 'If you love bass these will make you happy. I prefer a more balanced sound and the default tuning muddies vocals a bit, though adjusting my phone''s equalizer helps.', true, true, 2, '2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Bass lovers will be happy', 'The bass is deep and full without drowning out the rest of the music. Hip hop and electronic tracks sound fantastic, and acoustic songs still feel natural.', true, true, 165, '2025-07-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Rohan D.', 2, 'Mic is nearly useless', 'Fine for music, but the microphone picks up everything around me and my voice sounds muffled. I bought these mostly for work calls, so that is a real letdown.', false, true, 6, '2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Aditya G.', 5, 'Perfect for the gym', 'They stay put during workouts and have survived plenty of sweaty sessions so far. Sound stays strong even with the gym music blasting in the background.', true, true, 118, '2025-07-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Sneha P.', 3, 'Fine for casual listening', 'They do the job for podcasts and background music. Picky listeners will notice the highs get harsh at high volume, but for everyday listening I have no big complaints.', true, true, 68, '2025-09-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71FOccCOQmL', 'Amit H.', 1, 'Battery falls short', 'The battery life is nowhere near what was promised. I get maybe half the advertised time at moderate volume, which means charging every single day.', true, true, 63, '2025-12-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'A gift that went down well', 'Bought these as a birthday gift for my teenage son and he has barely taken them off since. He says the sound is way better than his old pair.', true, true, 192, '2025-07-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Comfortable for hours', 'Comfort was my main concern since I wear glasses and most headphones give me a headache by lunchtime. I can keep these on through a full workday without any pressure or soreness, and I''ve even fallen asleep wearing them on the couch.', false, true, 146, '2026-06-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Priya S.', 4, 'Bass lovers will be happy', 'The bass is deep and full without drowning out the rest of the music. Hip hop and electronic tracks sound fantastic, and acoustic songs still feel natural.', true, true, 121, '2025-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Rahul K.', 5, 'Ideal for working from home', 'I use these all day for meetings and music while I work from home. Light enough that I forget I''m wearing them, and the controls are easy to find without looking.', true, true, 41, '2026-08-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Neha C.', 3, 'Decent, but the mic is weak', 'Music sounds great and the battery is solid. On calls though, people say I sound a little distant, especially outdoors when it''s windy.', true, true, 67, '2025-10-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Karthik V.', 4, 'Pairing is painless', 'Paired with my phone in seconds and they reconnect automatically every time I switch them on. Moving over to my laptop is also quick, which I really appreciate.', true, true, 163, '2025-08-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Kavya I.', 2, 'Uncomfortable for me', 'I really wanted to like these, but they press uncomfortably after thirty minutes. I tried adjusting the fit several ways and nothing helped, so they are going back.', true, true, 63, '2026-02-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-81TGXuOMAL', 'Aditya G.', 3, 'Bass heavy for my taste', 'If you love bass these will make you happy. I prefer a more balanced sound and the default tuning muddies vocals a bit, though adjusting my phone''s equalizer helps.', true, true, 69, '2026-04-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Neha C.', 5, 'Easy to carry everywhere', 'I carry this between classes every day and it never feels like a burden in my bag. It still feels solid, with no flex in the lid or around the keyboard.', false, true, 14, '2025-08-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Vikram M.', 4, 'Webcam is a step up', 'Video calls look noticeably better than on my previous laptop. The webcam is clear and the microphones pick up my voice without much background noise.', true, true, 250, '2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Karthik V.', 4, 'Quiet under normal use', 'The fans stay silent for everyday work like email, documents and streaming. They only spin up noticeably when I''m exporting videos, and even then it isn''t loud.', false, true, 7, '2026-07-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'Keyboard is a joy', 'I type for a living and this keyboard feels great, with good travel and a satisfying response. The trackpad is smooth and accurate too.', true, true, 136, '2026-03-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Pooja B.', 3, 'Good laptop, dim screen', 'Speed and keyboard are both solid. The screen is a bit dim for my liking and struggles near bright windows, though it''s perfectly fine indoors.', false, true, 44, '2026-03-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Priya S.', 4, 'No regrets after two months', 'After two months of daily work and weekend streaming, I have no complaints. Fast, dependable and comfortable to use for long stretches at a time.', true, true, 85, '2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Rohan D.', 2, 'Wi-Fi keeps disconnecting', 'It drops the wireless connection several times a day while every other device in the house stays connected. Driver updates haven''t fixed it.', true, true, 24, '2026-01-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71r2ySSfgBL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Solid, but the fan is audible', 'Handles my workload without any trouble. The fan kicks in more often than I would like, even during video calls, and it''s noticeable in a quiet room.', true, true, 54, '2026-06-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Huge upgrade from my old laptop', 'Coming from a five-year-old machine, this feels incredibly quick. Apps open instantly and I no longer sit around waiting for updates to finish.', true, true, 234, '2025-09-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Quiet under normal use', 'The fans stay silent for everyday work like email, documents and streaming. They only spin up noticeably when I''m exporting videos, and even then it isn''t loud.', true, true, 14, '2026-01-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
