  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Siddharth J.', 5, 'All-day battery for me', 'I unplug in the morning and still have charge left by the time I get home. After a month of use the battery life has stayed consistent.', false, true, 305, '2025-07-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Pooja B.', 3, 'Fast but runs warm', 'Performance is great for the price, but the bottom gets warm on my lap during longer sessions. I use it on a desk most of the time now.', true, true, 32, '2026-01-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Divya L.', 4, 'Keyboard is a joy', 'I type for a living and this keyboard feels great, with good travel and a satisfying response. The trackpad is smooth and accurate too.', true, true, 248, '2026-01-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Karthik V.', 2, 'Sluggish right out of the box', 'Even basic tasks like opening a browser feel slow. I expected far more responsiveness, and after a week of trying to speed it up I''m returning it.', true, true, 24, '2026-07-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61aLy7kImQL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Too many preinstalled apps', 'Once I removed the preinstalled apps and trial offers, it runs well and I''m happy with it. Getting there took an annoying first evening of cleanup though, and a couple of pop-ups kept nagging me to sign up for things I never asked for.', true, true, 65, '2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41bdNUDc8pL', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Quiet under normal use', 'The fans stay silent for everyday work like email, documents and streaming. They only spin up noticeably when I''m exporting videos, and even then it isn''t loud.', true, true, 212, '2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z'),
