  ('in-41bdNUDc8pL', 'Meera T.', 2, 'Battery life disappointing', 'The battery drains far faster than advertised. I barely get a few hours of light browsing, so I''m tethered to the charger most of the day.', true, true, 31, '2025-07-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
