  ('in-41bdNUDc8pL', 'Divya L.', 3, 'Nice keyboard, fussy trackpad', 'Typing feels good and the screen is sharp. The trackpad occasionally registers my palm while I type, so I mostly use a mouse now.', false, true, 33, '2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
