  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Reliable for family meals', 'I cook for my family every evening and it has been completely reliable. Sturdy, consistent and easy to clean afterwards, even on the busiest nights.', true, true, 85, '2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Ananya R.', 5, 'Daily cooking made simpler', 'I cook twice a day for a busy household and this has quickly become my go-to. Meals come together faster, cleanup is easier, and I''ve stopped reaching for my older pieces altogether. My mother-in-law even asked where I bought it when she visited last month.', true, true, 300, '2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Solid quality for the money', 'I compared several options before choosing this and I''m glad I did. The quality is excellent for what I paid and it has handled everything I''ve cooked so far.', true, true, 82, '2026-03-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Rohan D.', 5, 'Great gift for a new home', 'Bought this for my sister when she moved into her first apartment. She cooks with it almost every day and keeps telling me how easy it is to use.', true, true, 121, '2026-01-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Looks as good as it cooks', 'The finish looks elegant and has held up well so far, with no stains or discoloration after regular use. I leave it out on the stove because it looks nice.', false, true, 209, '2026-03-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Meera T.', 3, 'Great performance, a bit heavy', 'Heat distribution is excellent and it feels durable. It''s heavier than I expected though, which makes it tiring to lift when full.', true, true, 17, '2025-08-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Priya S.', 4, 'Sturdy and well made', 'It feels solid and heavy in the right way, with a thick base that doesn''t wobble on the stove. Clearly built to last years of daily cooking.', true, true, 302, '2026-04-26T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51K1LMDAvkL', 'Aditya G.', 2, 'Arrived with a dent', 'It arrived with a visible dent and a scratched finish. The replacement was fine, but the first experience left me wary about quality control.', true, true, 15, '2026-01-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51z8bjUc4kL', 'Meera T.', 5, 'Daily cooking made simpler', 'I cook twice a day for a busy household and this has quickly become my go-to. Meals come together faster, cleanup is easier, and I''ve stopped reaching for my older pieces altogether. My mother-in-law even asked where I bought it when she visited last month.', true, true, 273, '2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
