  ('in-51z8bjUc4kL', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Nice weight, not too heavy', 'It has enough heft to feel like quality but is still easy to lift and pour from, even when it''s full. A good balance for everyday use.', true, true, 58, '2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
