  ('in-51z8bjUc4kL', 'Priya S.', 4, 'Lid fits snugly', 'The lid sits snugly and locks in steam well. Soups and curries cook faster than they did in my old pots, and nothing spills over onto the stove.', true, true, 284, '2026-06-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
