  ('in-51z8bjUc4kL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Good, not great', 'It does the job for basic everyday cooking. Heat spreads unevenly on my smaller burner, so I''ve learned to use the larger one whenever I can.', true, true, 49, '2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
