  ('in-712NemmvADL', 'Meera T.', 4, 'Great quality for the price', 'The material and stitching feel much better than I expected at this price. Nothing loose, nothing uneven, and the finish is neat.', true, true, 321, '2026-06-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
