  ('in-712NemmvADL', 'Pooja B.', 5, 'Easy to move in', 'Moves with me through stretches, lunges and quick sprints without feeling restrictive. Ideal for the mixed workouts I do at the gym.', true, true, 288, '2025-08-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
