  ('in-61IZBgcmGL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'My go-to for workouts', 'I wear this for gym sessions four times a week and it has quickly become the first thing I reach for. Comfortable, flexible and it still looks new after a month.', true, true, 148, '2026-04-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61IZBgcmGL', 'Sneha P.', 3, 'Fit is slightly off', 'The length is right, but it felt a little snug in places the first few times I wore it. It loosened up somewhat after a week, and now it''s decent, though I''d probably size up if I ordered again.', true, true, 21, '2025-10-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
