  ('in-61IZBgcmGL', 'Divya L.', 2, 'Not breathable at all', 'Gets hot and stuffy within minutes of starting a workout. I end up drenched and uncomfortable, which defeats the purpose of buying it for exercise.', true, true, 0, '2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61IZBgcmGL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Comfortable but plain', 'Very comfortable and fits well. The design is plainer in person than in the photos, which is fine for the gym but less so for casual outings.', true, true, 69, '2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
