  ('in-61abSFH0qL', 'Vikram M.', 3, 'Nice look, a bit warm', 'Looks great and feels well made. It''s a little warmer than I hoped on really hot days, so I save it for cooler mornings and evenings.', true, true, 11, '2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61abSFH0qL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Comfortable all day long', 'Spent a full day running errands and walking around town, and stayed comfortable from morning till night. No rubbing, no irritation anywhere.', true, true, 254, '2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61abSFH0qL', 'Ananya R.', 2, 'Poor quality material', 'The material feels thin and rough, and it lost its shape after the first few uses. Not something I would buy again.', true, true, 56, '2026-08-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61abSFH0qL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Fit is slightly off', 'The length is right, but it felt a little snug in places the first few times I wore it. It loosened up somewhat after a week, and now it''s decent, though I''d probably size up if I ordered again.', true, true, 34, '2025-12-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61tvXQQDhL', 'Divya L.', 5, 'A little goes a long way', 'I only need a small amount each time, so it''s lasting far longer than I expected. Great value considering how well it works.', true, true, 219, '2026-04-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61tvXQQDhL', 'Amit H.', 4, 'Repurchasing for sure', 'This is my second time buying it and it won''t be the last. Consistent results, no irritation and a routine I actually manage to stick to.', true, true, 252, '2026-03-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61tvXQQDhL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Skin feels so soft', 'After a couple of weeks my skin feels noticeably softer and looks more even. I look forward to my routine now instead of rushing through it.', true, true, 94, '2026-04-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61tvXQQDhL', 'Arjun N.', 5, 'Works for both of us', 'My teenage daughter and I both use it, and it suits both our skin types. It''s rare to find something we can happily share.', true, true, 35, '2026-06-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61tvXQQDhL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Great feel, runs out fast', 'I love how it feels on my skin, but it runs out quicker than I expected with daily use. I would buy it again, but probably only on a discount.', false, true, 17, '2026-06-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
