  ('in-51gQUz3N6ZL', 'Divya L.', 4, 'No breakouts at all', 'I have acne-prone skin and was honestly nervous to try something new, since most products leave me with a fresh crop of spots. Six weeks in, there are no new breakouts, my existing ones seem to calm down faster, and my skin feels less oily by the afternoon.', true, true, 277, '2025-07-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51gQUz3N6ZL', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Works for both of us', 'My teenage daughter and I both use it, and it suits both our skin types. It''s rare to find something we can happily share.', true, true, 310, '2025-10-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
