  ('in-51gQUz3N6ZL', 'Meera T.', 3, 'Good, but slow to show results', 'It''s gentle and pleasant to use, though it took nearly a month before I noticed any difference. Patience is definitely required.', true, true, 4, '2025-07-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
