  ('in-51gQUz3N6ZL', 'Ananya R.', 3, 'Nice results, strong scent', 'My skin looks better after a few weeks of use, but the scent is stronger than I would like. It fades after a while, so I''ve learned to live with it.', true, true, 24, '2026-03-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
