  ('in-51Y0eeQykEL', 'Karthik V.', 4, 'Great in humid weather', 'Where I live it is humid most of the year, and this doesn''t leave my face greasy or shiny by midday. It feels fresh and comfortable all day.', true, true, 249, '2026-01-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51Y0eeQykEL', 'Rahul K.', 4, 'Simple routine, real results', 'I wanted a simple routine without ten different steps, and this delivers. My skin feels balanced and comfortable without any fuss.', true, true, 244, '2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
