  ('in-51Y0eeQykEL', 'Amit H.', 3, 'Works, but slightly drying', 'It does what it promises, but my skin feels a bit dry by the evening. I pair it with an extra moisturizer and that solves the problem.', true, true, 62, '2025-07-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51Y0eeQykEL', 'Aditya G.', 4, 'Visible glow after a month', 'I took before and after photos, and the difference after a month is real. My skin looks brighter and more rested, even on days I sleep badly.', true, true, 316, '2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
