  ('in-51Y0eeQykEL', 'Divya L.', 3, 'Fine for my skin type', 'It suits my combination skin reasonably well. Nothing dramatic, but no irritation either, and it fits easily into my existing routine.', true, true, 30, '2026-02-12T00:00:00.000Z');
