  ('in-A1dtQsoQEL', 'Rahul K.', 5, 'Pacing is spot on', 'The pacing never drags. Just when I thought I knew where things were headed, it shifted in a way that kept me hooked right to the end.', true, true, 145, '2026-05-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
