  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Siddharth J.', 4, 'Perfect for my parents', 'Bought this for my father, who is not very tech savvy and was nervous about switching phones. The interface is simple enough that he now makes video calls to the grandkids on his own, and the text is large and easy for him to read.', true, true, 15, '2026-04-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Neha C.', 5, 'Loud, clear calls', 'Call quality is excellent and the speaker is loud enough to hear in a noisy market. Network reception has been strong even indoors.', true, true, 110, '2025-11-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Rahul K.', 3, 'Nice display, gets warm', 'The screen is lovely for videos. It does get warm while charging and during longer gaming sessions, which takes away a bit from the experience.', true, true, 65, '2025-07-12T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'Looks premium', 'The design looks and feels much more expensive than it is. Slim, comfortable to hold, and it gets compliments at work.', true, true, 227, '2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Sneha P.', 2, 'Lags after an update', 'It worked smoothly for the first month, but after a software update it started lagging and freezing. Even basic scrolling stutters now.', true, true, 36, '2026-07-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-51A42gljwLL', 'Amit H.', 3, 'Good phone, too many ads', 'Performance and display are both solid for daily use, and the battery is dependable. The preinstalled apps and occasional ads in the notifications are annoying, though, and it took me a good half hour of digging through settings to switch most of them off.', true, true, 25, '2026-05-16T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Meera T.', 5, 'Perfect for my parents', 'Bought this for my father, who is not very tech savvy and was nervous about switching phones. The interface is simple enough that he now makes video calls to the grandkids on his own, and the text is large and easy for him to read.', true, true, 156, '2025-12-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Stays cool under load', 'Even after an hour of gaming or navigation on long drives, it only gets slightly warm. Much better than my old phone in this summer heat.', true, true, 221, '2025-09-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'Good for students', 'My daughter uses it for online classes, notes and chatting with friends. It handles everything smoothly and she loves the camera.', true, true, 71, '2025-07-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Divya L.', 5, 'Battery easily lasts a day', 'With heavy use including social media, video calls and a bit of gaming, I still end the day with charge left. Battery life is excellent.', true, true, 61, '2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Charges quickly', 'The fast charging is a lifesaver. A short top-up while I get ready in the morning gives me more than enough for the day.', true, true, 225, '2025-11-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Rahul K.', 3, 'Good value, bulky feel', 'Great features for the price, but it feels a bit heavy and thick in the hand. It took me a few days to get used to it.', true, true, 7, '2026-07-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Ananya R.', 4, 'Bright, vivid display', 'The display is bright enough to read easily in harsh afternoon sunlight. Videos look vivid and scrolling feels really smooth.', true, true, 52, '2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71MJioULjzL', 'Amit H.', 2, 'Heats up quickly', 'Gets uncomfortably hot within minutes of video calls or navigation. I have to take off the cover just to let it cool down.', true, true, 52, '2026-08-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Camera is impressive', 'Daylight photos are sharp and the colours look natural. I took it to a family wedding and the pictures came out better than I expected.', true, true, 176, '2026-05-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Karthik V.', 4, 'Loud, clear calls', 'Call quality is excellent and the speaker is loud enough to hear in a noisy market. Network reception has been strong even indoors.', true, true, 131, '2026-01-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Amit H.', 3, 'Great battery, average camera', 'The battery life is outstanding, easily lasting me a day and a half. The camera is fine in daylight, but low-light photos come out grainy.', true, true, 34, '2026-06-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Siddharth J.', 4, 'Stays cool under load', 'Even after an hour of gaming or navigation on long drives, it only gets slightly warm. Much better than my old phone in this summer heat.', true, true, 99, '2026-07-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Neha C.', 2, 'Network keeps dropping', 'Calls drop frequently and the internet keeps disconnecting in places where my old phone never had any problems. Very frustrating for work.', false, true, 56, '2025-09-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Charges quickly', 'The fast charging is a lifesaver. A short top-up while I get ready in the morning gives me more than enough for the day.', true, true, 310, '2026-07-09T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Aditya G.', 3, 'Decent, but charging is slow', 'Everything works well enough, but charging from empty takes much longer than I''m used to. I''ve started charging it overnight.', false, true, 26, '2026-05-19T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41t4RIHRQtL', 'Meera T.', 1, 'Battery drains fast', 'The battery drains far faster than advertised, even with light use. I have to carry a power bank everywhere now.', true, true, 29, '2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-617ORkwdPL', 'Sneha P.', 5, 'Reliable daily driver', 'Three months in and it has been completely reliable. No crashes, no random restarts, and the battery is still holding up well.', true, true, 21, '2026-02-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-617ORkwdPL', 'Rohan D.', 5, 'Great value phone', 'For what I paid, this phone does everything I need and more. Compared with what my friends spent on theirs, I feel like I got a great deal.', true, true, 299, '2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z'),
