  ('in-61ATaTpvEQL', 'Vikram M.', 4, 'Calling works great', 'Taking calls from my wrist while cooking or driving has been a game changer, especially when my phone is charging in another room. People hear me clearly, the speaker is loud enough indoors, and switching back to the phone mid-call is easy.', true, true, 106, '2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61ATaTpvEQL', 'Pooja B.', 2, 'Battery nowhere near claimed', 'Battery life is barely a couple of days with normal use, far from what was advertised. Constant charging defeats the purpose.', true, true, 56, '2025-09-26T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61ATaTpvEQL', 'Neha C.', 3, 'Battery shorter with calling', 'The battery is excellent with basic use, but taking calls regularly cuts it down noticeably. I now charge it every few days.', true, true, 66, '2026-01-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
