  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Vikram M.', 3, 'Nice look, a bit warm', 'Looks great and feels well made. It''s a little warmer than I hoped on really hot days, so I save it for cooler mornings and evenings.', true, true, 18, '2026-03-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Amit H.', 4, 'Great for long walks', 'My doctor told me to walk more, and I''ve done an hour every evening in this for three weeks. Still comfortable at the end, with no soreness or chafing.', false, true, 105, '2026-05-30T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Karthik V.', 2, 'Looks different from the photos', 'The material looks and feels cheaper in person, and the shade is duller than in the product images. I returned it the same day.', true, true, 69, '2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Pooja B.', 5, 'Looks sharp, feels better', 'Looks clean and modern enough to wear casually, not just for exercise. I''ve already received a couple of compliments from friends.', true, true, 100, '2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Siddharth J.', 3, 'Good value, basic finish', 'For the price it does what it should. The finish is not premium and some stitching looks a little uneven, but it is comfortable enough for daily workouts.', true, true, 8, '2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-61xTfKaqUlL', 'Divya L.', 1, 'Poor quality material', 'The material feels thin and rough, and it lost its shape after the first few uses. Not something I would buy again.', true, true, 12, '2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Priya S.', 5, 'Better than the audiobook', 'I listened to the audiobook first and then bought the print copy. Reading it at my own pace brought out details I had completely missed while listening.', true, true, 64, '2025-07-14T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Rohan D.', 5, 'Lovely print quality', 'The paper is thick, the print is crisp and the binding feels solid. It looks great on my shelf and holds up well to being carried around in my bag.', true, true, 87, '2025-08-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Divya L.', 4, 'Stayed with me for days', 'I finished it a week ago and I''m still thinking about it. Very few books leave me reflecting for this long.', true, true, 33, '2026-05-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Genuinely thought-provoking', 'It made me see a few things in my own life differently. The ideas feel fresh, and the writing never talks down to the reader.', true, true, 133, '2026-06-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Pooja B.', 4, 'Couldn''t put it down', 'Started it on a Sunday afternoon, telling myself I''d read just a couple of chapters, and finished well past midnight. Every chapter pulled me straight into the next, and I was genuinely sorry when it ended. I''ve already pressed it on two friends.', true, true, 299, '2026-03-22T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Arjun N.', 3, 'The ending divided us', 'I enjoyed most of it, but the ending left me with mixed feelings. Our book club was split right down the middle on it.', true, true, 47, '2025-08-20T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Neha C.', 4, 'Pacing is spot on', 'The pacing never drags. Just when I thought I knew where things were headed, it shifted in a way that kept me hooked right to the end.', true, true, 274, '2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-91Sy3S198L', 'Karthik V.', 2, 'Could not get into it', 'I tried three times to get past the first few chapters and never connected with it. The writing just felt flat to me.', true, true, 17, '2026-03-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Kavya I.', 5, 'Better than the audiobook', 'I listened to the audiobook first and then bought the print copy. Reading it at my own pace brought out details I had completely missed while listening.', true, true, 116, '2026-04-25T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Amit H.', 5, 'Worth the hype', 'I was skeptical after seeing it recommended everywhere, but it absolutely lives up to the praise. Engaging from the first page to the last.', true, true, 40, '2026-01-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Arjun N.', 4, 'Genuinely thought-provoking', 'It made me see a few things in my own life differently. The ideas feel fresh, and the writing never talks down to the reader.', true, true, 20, '2025-09-18T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Rahul K.', 5, 'Instant keeper', 'I rarely reread anything, but I already know I will come back to this one. It has earned a permanent place on my bookshelf.', true, true, 104, '2026-08-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Sneha P.', 4, 'Beautifully written', 'The writing is thoughtful and precise, the kind where you reread sentences just to enjoy them again. Easily one of the best things I''ve read this year.', true, true, 274, '2026-06-11T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Rohan D.', 3, 'Good read, predictable at times', 'Enjoyable and well written overall. I saw a couple of the big turns coming, though, which took away some of the impact.', true, true, 59, '2026-07-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Ananya R.', 4, 'Pacing is spot on', 'The pacing never drags. Just when I thought I knew where things were headed, it shifted in a way that kept me hooked right to the end.', true, true, 291, '2025-09-13T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-919dIRLFTeL', 'Pooja B.', 2, 'Damaged copy arrived', 'The cover was creased and several pages were coming loose from the binding. Disappointing for something I had bought as a gift.', true, true, 19, '2026-02-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71q6gvpgW8L', 'Amit H.', 5, 'Better than the audiobook', 'I listened to the audiobook first and then bought the print copy. Reading it at my own pace brought out details I had completely missed while listening.', true, true, 13, '2025-08-02T00:00:00.000Z'),
