  ('in-71q6gvpgW8L', 'Meera T.', 3, 'Great writing, dense in places', 'The writing is impressive, but some passages are dense enough that I had to reread them. Rewarding if you have the patience for it.', true, true, 19, '2026-04-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
