  ('in-41y8H3QmVqL', 'Rohan D.', 5, 'Arrived in perfect condition', 'Well packed, no bent corners, and the cover looks exactly like the photos. The reading itself lived up to my expectations too.', true, true, 279, '2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41y8H3QmVqL', 'Aditya G.', 5, 'Perfect for book club', 'Our book club picked this and it sparked our longest discussion in months. Everyone came away with a different take, which made for a great evening.', true, true, 49, '2026-06-27T00:00:00.000Z'),
