  ('in-41y8H3QmVqL', 'Siddharth J.', 3, 'Worth reading, print so-so', 'The reading itself is absolutely worth it and I''d recommend it. The print is quite small and the paper feels thin, though, so reading in bed with a dim lamp strained my eyes. I might go with the audiobook or a different edition next time.', true, true, 69, '2025-07-08T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-41y8H3QmVqL', 'Kavya I.', 2, 'Overhyped and repetitive', 'After all the praise I expected much more. It circles the same ground over and over, and I was bored well before the end.', false, true, 3, '2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('in-71m8hR9ZUfL', 'Neha C.', 5, 'Worth the hype', 'I was skeptical after seeing it recommended everywhere, but it absolutely lives up to the praise. Engaging from the first page to the last.', false, true, 259, '2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z'),
