  ('in-71m8hR9ZUfL', 'Kavya I.', 3, 'Strong start, slower middle', 'The opening had me hooked immediately, but the middle section dragged for me. It picked up again near the end, so I''m glad I kept going.', false, true, 5, '2026-08-23T00:00:00.000Z'),
